# The SQLite database: password hashes and every user's churning history. Never committed.
#
# Anchored with a leading slash, and that matters more than it looks. Unanchored, `data/` matches a
# directory of that name at *any* depth — which silently excluded `src/core/data/`, the card catalog
# and both bonus snapshots, i.e. the entire data layer the app depends on. `git status` says nothing
# when a whole directory is ignored.
/data/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

node_modules/
.DS_Store
*.log

# Real deployment credentials. Only the sample is tracked.
.kamal/secrets

# The typecheck scratch install. Not a dependency — see the Makefile.
/.tools/

# Expo build output and caches.
/app/.expo/
/app/dist/
/app/web-build/

# Playwright MCP scratch output.
/.playwright-mcp/
